        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">FF149 adds support for <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CSSNumericValue/to" rel="nofollow"><code class="notranslate">CSSNumericValue.to()</code></a> behind the pref <code class="notranslate">layout.css.typed-om.enabled</code> in <a href="https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2013251" rel="nofollow">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=2013251</a></p>
